<title>JAPAN: Nippon Kagaku Yakin - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Kagaku Yakin - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.94		vs	    2.19</p>
<p> Operating   loss 143 million	 vs	 prft 13 million</p>
<p> Current     loss 137 million	 vs	 prft 33 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 116 million	 vs	 prft 23 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 22.04 yen	  vs     prft 4.46 yen</p>
<p> Shares		5 million	  vs	   5 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Kagaku Yakin Co Ltd is a top maker and seller of oil-impregnated bearings.</p>
</text>
